  "body": "The [Source Phase Imports](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-source-phase-imports) proposal requires that objects returned for the source phase must inherit from the new `AbstractModuleSource` intrinsic in their prototype chain.\r\n\r\nIn order for the WebAssembly ESM Integration to express this inheritance in WebIDL, once Stage 3 is obtained for the proposal, we need to determine how to represent this intrinsic inheritance for `AbstractModuleSource`.\r\n\r\nCreating this as a new tracking issue for this ~~interface type definition~~question.",
